t="GWM-1: our state-of-the-art General World Model, built to simulate reality in real time. Interactive, controllable and general-purpose."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://runway.com/research/introducing-runway-gwm-1"/><meta property="og:title" content="Runway Research | Introducing Runway GWM-1"/><meta property="og:description" content="GWM-1: our state-of-the-art General World Model, built to simulate reality in real time. Interactive, controllable and general-purpose."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://d3phaj0sisr2ct.cloudfront.net/site/images/research/gwm/gwm-card-01.png"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Runway Research | Introducing Runway GWM-1"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="GWM-1: our state-of-the-art General World Model, built to simulate reality in real time. Interactive, controllable and general-purpose."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://d3phaj0sisr2ct.cloudfront.net/site/images/research/gwm/gwm-card-01.png"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.png?icon.35ps9bmugbe1e.png" sizes="320x320" type="image/png"/><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://image.mux.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://stream.mux.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://d3phaj0sisr2ct.cloudfront.net"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en" href="https://runway.com/research/introducing-runway-gwm-1"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="x-default" href="https://runway.com/research/introducing-runway-gwm-1"/><script>(self.__next_s=self.__next_s||[]).push([0,{"children":"window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\nfunction gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\nwindow.gtag = window.gtag || gtag;\n// analytics_storage default. Cookiebot loads afterInteractive, so a blanket\n// 'denied' here left every page load with a dead window (until uc.js booted)\n// in which implied-consent visitors who bounced or clicked through to\n// app.runwayml.com produced zero analytics and no attribution cookie.\n// Resolve synchronously instead — mirrors hasSynchronousCategoryConsent() in\n// src/lib/cookiebotConsent.ts (vanilla JS duplicate: this runs before any\n// bundle loads):\n//   1. Cookiebot's own first-party CookieConsent cookie — a returning\n//      visitor's stored decision (accept OR decline) always wins.\n//   2. rw_consent_region, stamped by the proxy from x-vercel-ip-country:\n//      'implied' (US/ROW) grants; 'explicit' (EU/EEA/UK/CH) denies.\n//   3. No cookie at all (e.g. local dev): denied, wait for Cookiebot.\n// Ad keys stay denied for everyone until Cookiebot updates them, which also\n// preserves the old GPC posture (GPC only ever gated the ad stack).\nfunction rwReadCookie(name) {\n  var m = document.cookie.match(new RegExp('(?:^|; )' + name + '=([^;]*)'));\n  return m ? m[1] : null;\n}\nvar rwStoredStats = null;\nvar rwCbStored = rwReadCookie('CookieConsent');\nif (rwCbStored) {\n  try {\n    var rwCbMatch = decodeURIComponent(rwCbStored).match(/statistics:(true|false)/);\n    if (rwCbMatch) rwStoredStats = rwCbMatch[1] === 'true';\n  } catch (e) {}\n}\nvar rwRegion = rwReadCookie('rw_consent_region');\nvar rwAnalyticsDefault =\n  (rwStoredStats === null ? rwRegion === 'implied' : rwStoredStats)\n    ? 'granted'\n    : 'denied';\ngtag('consent', 'default', {\n  ad_storage: 'denied',\n  ad_user_data: 'denied',\n  ad_personalization: 'denied',\n  analytics_storage: rwAnalyticsDefault,\n  functionality_storage: 'granted',\n  security_storage: 'granted',\n  // Cookiebot loads afterInteractive (to avoid the banner's hydration\n  // mismatch) and issues its consent 'update' fairly late. 500ms expired\n  // before the grant arrived, so Consent Mode tags evaluated at 'denied' on\n  // the page_view trigger and never re-fired — 0 tags fired all session.\n  // 2000ms covers Cookiebot's grant latency so the tags wait for it.\n  wait_for_update: 2000,\n});\ngtag('set', 'ads_data_redaction', true);\ngtag('set', 'url_passthrough', true);","id":"consent-default"}])</script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0c0hxoamwjsbw.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="abcnormal_d55cd778-module__KOiC8a__variable timesnow_bd5a815e-module__7PsZNG__variable font-sans flex min-h-screen flex-col" id="layout"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><noscript><iframe src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-MV6ZPBC" height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript><header class="fixed z-40 w-full bg-opacity-95 py-4 transition-all duration-200 lg:py-0 top-[60px] sm:top-[36px] lg:top-[48px] text-white min-[1600px]:bg-white min-[1600px]:text-offBlack  text-white "><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md transition-opacity duration-200 opacity-0"></div><div class="rw-container"><div class="static z-10 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="relative z-20 lg:flex-1"><a aria-label="Runway home" class="relative inline-flex translate-y-1 items-center hover:text-mediumGray" href="/"><svg width="87" class="transition-all duration-200" viewBox="0 0 84 19" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6.616 4.55643C5.07392 4.55643 4.24817 5.47958 4.24817 7.11515V14.1792H0V0.332031H2.38773L3.88006 1.92747C4.58643 0.893949 5.65096 0.332031 7.08359 0.332031H8.367V4.55643H6.616Z" class="fill-current"></path><path d="M9.39062 0.332031H13.6388V8.10853C13.6388 9.55346 14.574 10.5468 15.9469 10.5468C17.3199 10.5468 18.2352 9.55346 18.2352 8.10853V0.332031H22.4833V14.1792H20.0956L18.6431 12.6239C17.6581 13.808 16.2553 14.5003 14.6237 14.5003C11.5296 14.5003 9.39062 12.2226 9.39062 8.90124V0.332031Z" class="fill-current"></path><path d="M36.939 14.1683H32.6909V6.44196C32.6909 4.9569 31.7457 3.94344 30.323 3.94344C28.9003 3.94344 27.9552 4.9569 27.9552 6.44196V14.1683H23.707V0.321096H26.0948L27.5672 1.89646C28.5521 0.692359 29.9748 0 31.6462 0C34.7801 0 36.939 2.30787 36.939 5.66932V14.1583V14.1683Z" class="fill-c