        </style><!--$?--><template id="B:5"></template><!--/$--></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="text-white text-lg font-medium text-center !leading-none px-8">Gen-4.5 Updates</div></div></a></div></div></section><section id="robotics-section"><div class="rw-container"><div class="border-t-[0.50px] border-[#C6C6C6] lg:pt-16 lg:pb-24 pt-10 pb-16"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row"><aside class="lg:w-4/16 w-full mb-6 lg:mb-0"><div class="text-sm mb-2">GWM-1</div><div class="text-3xl leading-none">World Models <br/>for Robotics</div></aside><article class="lg:w-12/16 w-full lg:pr-1/16"><div class="text-neutral-950 leading-tight text-3xl">GWM Robotics brings a state-of-the-art video generation diffusion backbone to robotics — trained at the same scale and with the same large-scale pretraining as our frontier creative models.</div></article></div><div class="flex py-16"><article class="lg:w-12/16 w-full lg:ml-auto"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class=""><div class="aspect-video relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="w-full h-full object-cover next-video-container"><style>
        .next-video-container {
          display: grid;  /* Fixes a Safari aspect-ratio + height bug. */
