        </style><media-theme-sutro data-next-video="ready" style="display:grid"><img src="https://d3phaj0sisr2ct.cloudfront.net/site/images/research/gwm/thumb-audio-gen-shot-01.png" alt="Native Audio" class="w-full h-full object-cover scale-[1.02]" slot="poster"/><!--$?--><template id="B:b"></template><!--/$--></media-theme-sutro></div></div></article></div><div class="flex mt-12"><article class="lg:w-5/16 w-full lg:ml-4/16"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">Native Audio</div><div class="mb-6">Gen-4.5 can generate realistic dialogue compelling sound effects and immersive background audio, transforming the kinds of stories you can create with the model.</div></article></div><div class="flex mb-16"><article class="lg:w-12/16 w-full lg:ml-auto"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3"><div><div class="w-full aspect-video object-cover rounded-md overflow-hidden next-video-container"><style>
