div></div></section><section class="bg-[#F3F3F3] py-20 -mb-20" id="inquiry-form"><div class="rw-container"><div class="lg:w-14/16 mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row"><div class="lg:w-1/2 pr-2/16 text-4xl leading-none mb-10">Fill out this form to request GWM-1 early access</div><div class="lg:w-1/2"><div class="relative"><form><div class="flex flex-col mb-12 relative "><label for="fullName" class="pl-4 ">Full Name<span>*</span></label><input type="text" class="appearance-none mt-3 px-3.5 py-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring bg-transparent border-b-[0.5px] ring-darkGrayAlt border-darkGrayAlt border-opacity-40  " placeholder="Type your full name" name="fullName"/></div><div class="flex flex-col mb-12 relative "><label for="email" class="pl-4 ">Business email<span>*</span></label><input type="email" class="appearance-none mt-3 px-3.5 py-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring bg-transparent border-b-[0.5px] ring-darkGrayAlt border-darkGrayAlt border-opacity-40  " placeholder="Type your business email" name="email"/></div><div class="flex flex-col mb-12"><label for="companySize" class="pl-4 ">Company Size<span>*</span></label><div class="relative mt-3"><select name="companySize" class="appearance-none focus:outline-none focus:ring w-full rounded-[3px] border-[0.5px] px-3.5 py-2 bg-transparent ring-darkGrayAlt border-darkGrayAlt border-opacity-40  "><option value="">Select an option</option><option value="1-50">1-50</option><option value="51-200">51-200</option><option value="201-1,000">201-1,000</option><option value="1001-10,000">1001-10,000</option><option value="10,001+">10,001+</option></select><div class="absolute right-2 top-4 pointer-events-none"><svg width="10" height="7" viewBox="0 0 10 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.77801 4.55024L5.44961 1.22185C5.05909 0.831324 4.42592 0.831324 4.0354 1.22185L0.707006 4.55024C0.0770416 5.18021 0.523212 6.25735 1.41412 6.25735L8.0709 6.25735C8.9618 6.25735 9.40797 5.18021 8.77801 4.55024Z" fill="#0C0C0C"></p